	(text "Sensor flex (docs/DESIGN.md D-27): single layer, two 45 deg folds.\nJ1 mates the MSR-2's rear connector CN2 (MSR-2 powered through its 5V pin).\nJ2, J3: Harwin S7081-42R spring fingers on the target board (+5 V, GND from the wiring board).\nU1: SHT45 on the flex tail, I2C on the MSR-2 bus (SDA = IO1, SCL = IO0).\nMK1: I2S microphone (D-29), left channel; SCK = IO4, WS = IO6, SD = IO7 (CN2 contacts placeholder).\nMIC_3V3 / MIC_GND: the microphone's own CN2 contacts, joined to +3V3 / GND on the MSR-2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
